  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Isiolo Integrated Food Security Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this multi-sector project is to enhance the food security of marginalised communities in Isiolo district, Isiolo county. It will achieve this by:

&#x2022;	increasing household food production through: seed provision; planting fruit trees;  training in crop production methods, animal husbandry, and savings and lending schemes;
&#x2022;	improving disaster resilience through: DRR training and the formation of DRR committees; provision of energy saving jikos; conservation awareness raising; climate change advocacy; 
&#x2022;	improving water access and sanitation through: rehabilitation of the water intake; provision of latrines and washing facilities in schools and homes; hygiene and sanitation training of the community and community health workers;
&#x2022;	parental training and support to improve child nutrition and health;
&#x2022;	inter-ethnic peace-building activities at school and community levels; 
&#x2022;	staff capacity strengthening and training.</narrative>
  </description>
